 <p>Nade Ali asal mein yeh hi to he yaad e Ali</p> 
 <p>wajd mein jab bhi tera naam mein laita hon Ali<br> baithy baithy hi Najaf ghoomta rehta hon Ali<br> dil dhadakne ki sadao mein bhi sunta hu Ali<br> ae mere maula Ali yeh mohabbat teri<br> raah jaisi bhi ho mujhko nahi girnay deti</p> 
 <p>khaybari jung mein chaleeswa din aaya to<br> kaha Allah ne jibrael nabi se kehdo<br> woh jo Mazhar hai ajaaeb ka pukaro Usko<br> jab Ali aayega sab badal jaayegaa<br> jeet jaoge abhi jung parho mere nabi</p> 
 <p>rasta neel mein Moosa ko dikha deta hai<br> kashtie Nooh se tufaan hata deta hai<br> aur kahin naar ko gulzaar bana deta hai<br> hazrat e Adam se Mustafa tak sab ke<br> kaam aaya he yahi vird jahan jisne padhi</p> 
 <p>mera andaaz malangana banade Maula<br> jo tujhe dekhle woh dana banade Maula<br> mujhkoo Behlol sa deewana bana day Maula<br> ishq itna he mujhe mere maula tujse<br> mere seenay mein hai dil aur hai us dil pay likhi</p> 
 <p>khoya rehta hon shab o roz teri yaado mein<br> zindagi ban ke tu basta he meri saanson mein<br> dil laga rehta hai har waqt teri baton mein<br> aisa lagta he mujhe sath he tu mere<br> teri yaado se nikalny nahi deti hai kabhi</p> 
 <p>nezah Akbar ke kaleje se nikala to parhi<br> teer be sher ki gardan se jo khincha to parhi<br> aik gathrhi mein jo qasim ko sameta to parhi<br> laasha jab aun o mohammad ka uthaya to parhi<br> kat gaye haath gira ghoday se jab yaad e Ali<br> Shah lashay pay gaye parhte hue Nade Ali<br> algaraz Sheh ka gala Shimr ne jab kaata<br> kuch qadam dur se ro rokay behan padti rahi</p> 
 <p>pohnchain darbaar ke darwazay pay Zainab jis dam<br> khaak pay aise giri phir nahi uth paye qadam<br> yaad baba ki jab aayi to hui ankhen num<br> rokay Zainab ne kaha ho kahan ae baba<br> jab madad ke liye baba ko pukara to parhi</p> 
 <p>bediyon par jo girati rahi pani lakar<br> jo behan shaam tak aayi thi tamanche khakar<br> qaid se jo nahi ja paayi rihayi paker<br> uss behan ka laasha qabr mein jab rakha<br> uss ghari sayyade Sajjad ke honton par thi</p> 
 <p>jisske seenay mein he gham Zahra (s.a) ke ujrre ghar ka<br> bas woh darwaish he zeeshan o Raza iss dar ka<br> uss pay rehta hai karam shaam o sehar Haider ka<br> Ya hussaina kehna gham mein rotay rehna<br> Apne saaye mein azadaron tumhe rakhegi</p> 
